<title>USA: Monterey Bay names Bachan vice chairman.</title>
<headline>Monterey Bay names Bachan vice chairman.</headline>
<dateline>WATSONVILLE, Calif. 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monterey Bay Bancorp Inc said P.W. Bachan was named vice chairman of the board.</p>
<p>Bachan has been a director of the bank since 1954.</p>
